  tWorldName: {fileID: 1680755814069727064}
  worldImage: {fileID: 509211427372183645}
  tConditions: {fileID: 5302982203757509587}
  tTips: {fileID: 8641735886193156167}
  tCountdown: {fileID: 7938450130657237366}
  tPrice: {fileID: 8451386056651459855}
  bTravel: {fileID: 2359234965798789929}
  priceOkColor: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  priceNotEnoughColor: {r: 1, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
  conditionsEnglish: "Spiritaxi provides transportation services intended for Spirimonz
    hunters operating in environments that may involve unpredictable risks, including
    the presence of spiritual entities, energy anomalies, or hostile manifestations.
    By using Spiritaxi services, the user acknowledges full awareness of these risks
    and agrees to assume them voluntarily. Spiritaxi shall not be held liable for
    any physical harm, loss of consciousness, temporary possession, mental disturbances,
    or any other adverse effects resulting from interactions with malicious spirits,
    whether occurring inside a vehicle, near a taxi stop, or during transit.\n\nFurthermore,
    Spiritaxi disclaims all responsibility for any disappearance, injury, or incapacitation
    of a Spirimonz hunter arising in connection with the use of its services, including
    situations involving combat, escape attempts, or misjudgment of an entity\u2019s
    threat level. It is the sole responsibility of each user to ensure they are adequately
    trained, equipped, and protected before engaging in hunting activities. Use of
    the service constitutes full and unconditional acceptance of these terms, with
    no possibility of claims against Spiritaxi, its drivers, or any affiliated entities,
    whether material or spiritual."
  conditionsFrench: "Spiritaxi met \xE0 disposition un service de transport destin\xE9
    aux chasseurs de Spirimonz, op\xE9r\xE9 dans des environnements pouvant comporter
    des risques impr\xE9visibles li\xE9s \xE0 la pr\xE9sence d\u2019entit\xE9s spirituelles,
    d\u2019anomalies \xE9nerg\xE9tiques ou de manifestations hostiles. En utilisant
    les services de Spiritaxi, l\u2019utilisateur reconna\xEEt \xEAtre pleinement
    conscient de ces dangers et accepte de s\u2019y exposer volontairement. Spiritaxi
    ne saurait \xEAtre tenu responsable des dommages corporels, pertes de conscience,
    possessions temporaires, alt\xE9rations mentales ou tout autre effet ind\xE9sirable
    r\xE9sultant d\u2019une interaction avec des esprits malveillants, que celle-ci
    survienne \xE0 bord d\u2019un v\xE9hicule, \xE0 proximit\xE9 d\u2019un point
    d\u2019arr\xEAt ou durant un trajet.\n\nEn outre, Spiritaxi d\xE9cline toute
    responsabilit\xE9 en cas de disparition, blessure ou incapacit\xE9 d\u2019un
    chasseur de Spirimonz survenue dans le cadre de l\u2019utilisation du service,
    y compris lorsque ces \xE9v\xE9nements r\xE9sultent d\u2019un combat, d\u2019une
    fuite, ou d\u2019une mauvaise \xE9valuation du niveau de danger d\u2019une entit\xE9.
    Il appartient \xE0 chaque utilisateur de s\u2019assurer qu\u2019il dispose des
    comp\xE9tences, \xE9quipements et protections n\xE9cessaires avant d\u2019engager
    toute activit\xE9 de chasse. L\u2019utilisation du service implique l\u2019acceptation
    pleine et enti\xE8re de ces conditions, sans possibilit\xE9 de recours contre
    Spiritaxi, ses conducteurs ou toute entit\xE9 affili\xE9e, qu\u2019elle soit
    mat\xE9rielle ou spirituelle."
  tipsEnglish: Travel temporarily to a unique location to find exclusive Spirimonz.
  tipsFrench: Voyagez temporairement dans un lieu unique pour trouver des Spirimonz
    exclusifs.
  freeTextEnglish: Free
  freeTextFrench: Gratuit
  rotationHourLocal: 0
  rotationMinuteLocal: 0
  countdownRefreshInterval: 0.25
